{
  "source": "Claude Code documentation for 2.1.282 (hooks, errors, status line pages), read in lot 2 step A; not yet observed on a real limit (05, section 9). Times without a zone are the machine's local time; a status line window's resets_at is given as local time in resetsAtLocal and converted to Unix seconds by the test.",
